---List events in an application log group
---
---Returns matching events oldest first. Pass the group started_at and events_cursor as starting_after, retaining the original event filters. List cursors cannot be used here. Time bounds select groups by their start in the grouped list; group expansion reads events across the flow lifetime, subject to retention. Only forward pagination is supported. Requires `application_logs:read`. Payload fields, payload filtering, and full event payloads are not supported. `user_id` and `identifier` cannot be combined with each other or with `actor` or `subject`.
---
---`GET /platform/applications/{applicationID}/instances/{envOrInsID}/logs/groups/{groupID}/events`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, UnprocessableEntity, ResourceNotFound.
---@param input clerk.platform.ListInstanceLogGroupEventsRequest
---@return clerk.platform.GroupEventList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_instance_log_group_events(input) end

---List grouped application logs
---
---Returns groups and standalone events, newest first. Groups sort by their start time. Event filters retain groups and restrict their event previews; first_event can be outside those filters. Status is null until the flow concludes. An empty page with next_page_status=unknown can be continued using cursor.starting_after. Group filters exclude standalone events. Only forward pagination is supported. Requires `application_logs:read`. Payload fields, payload filtering, and full event payloads are not supported. `user_id` and `identifier` cannot be combined with each other or with `actor` or `subject`.
---
---`GET /platform/applications/{applicationID}/instances/{envOrInsID}/logs`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, UnprocessableEntity, ResourceNotFound.
---@param input clerk.platform.ListInstanceLogsRequest
---@return clerk.platform.GroupedLogList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_instance_logs(input) end

